s improvement:\n\nshow_accept(\n    vformat(TTR(\"Error saving resource: %s\\nPath: %s\"), \n        error_string(err), \n        p_path\n    ), \n    TTR(\"OK\")\n);\n\nNot sure if it would work.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3201525330/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3201570972","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109780#issuecomment-3201570972","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109780","id":3201570972,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-1Bic","user":{"login":"rainbowdesign","id":5581057,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1ODEwNTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5581057?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rainbowdesign","html_url":"https://github.com/rainbowdesign","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rainbowdesign/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rainbowdesign/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rainbowdesign/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rainbowdesign/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rainbowdesign/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rainbowdesign/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rainbowdesign/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rainbowdesign/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rainbowdesign/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-19T17:20:05Z","updated_at":"2025-08-19T17:20:05Z","body":"It turned out to not be the problem, the problem was a text file i created with code in it and could not safe for some strange reason, i dis